    "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 2010 reported a net prior year reserve release of GBP 40.613 million for the 2014 calendar year. This release primarily stems from the satisfactory run-off of prior closed years, including the 2012 Year of Account and earlier, which contributed a net profit of GBP 23.268 million, and the 2013 Year of Account, which contributed a net profit of GBP 17.345 million. The favourable development was attributed to a lack of major catastrophe events in the US and elsewhere for the 2013 YOA, and effective reinsurance arrangements for events like Hurricane Sandy (2012). However, 2014 saw several large losses, including Malaysian Airlines and Air Asia aircraft losses and a Tripoli Airport war loss, which affected the 2013 YOA but were largely protected by reinsurance.",
